---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-rig-700 bg-rig-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <img
          src="/logo.jpg"
          alt="FrankinFord Fabrications logo"
          class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full border border-rig-600 object-cover"
          width="56"
          height="56"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-50">
            Frankin<span class="text-ember-500">Ford</span> Fabrications
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 max-w-sm font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">
            Custom Ford truck fabrication &mdash; every cut, weld, and swap documented on camera.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ember-500">Follow the builds</p>
        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@FrankinFord7379"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-sm text-zinc-300 transition hover:text-ember-500"
        >
          YouTube &mdash; @FrankinFord7379
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-rig-700 pt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {year} FrankinFord Fabrications. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="max-w-2xl">
        Disclaimer: All fabrication work is performed by trained professionals. Custom modifications,
        chassis work, and drivetrain conversions may affect vehicle warranty, insurability, and road
        legality &mdash; verify requirements with your local DMV and insurer before undertaking a build.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
